	As I entered the room, I saw a gem lying in the middle of
the floor.  By my training I immediately recognized it as a diamond.
I held my trusty whip in hand, being suspicious of what appeared to
be a gift.  As I approached the gem, a garter snake hidden under it
bit me!  I *hate* snakes.

	Thag see goblin.  Goblin throw knife at Thag!  Thag angry.
