	As I opened the door, I realized that I was in a shop.
The merchant greeted me warmly.  "Welcome to Possogronoe's general
store!  And may I say that's a lovely shirt you're wearing."  He held
out a book to me.  "This would make a lovely souvenir for a friend
back home.  And it's a steal for only 800 gold."  As I looked it over,
I heard a noise behind me.  A kobold had entered the shop!  *This*
would be something to tell my friends.  I *had* to have its picture.

